    "heading": "Transaction recovery",
    "anchor": "transaction-recovery",
    "level": 2,
    "content": "Always persist the to your database before calling any financial operation. If the result does not arrive in within your timeout (typically 90 s), poll in the background: → Full implementation with code examples: Transaction Recovery — Android SDK"
