    "content": "Back-office operations are always available Backoffice REST API operations — tip adjustment, reversals, refunds, MOTO charges, batch management, deferred tokenization — are available alongside any integration path you choose. They go server-side directly to the payment gateway with no terminal or SDK required. Subject only to acquirer support."
