    "heading": "Tip Adjustment",
    "anchor": "tip-adjustment",
    "level": 3,
    "content": "— adjusts the tip amount of a completed sale before the day's batch is settled. This method does not use the card reader — it calls the Handpoint cloud API directly via . Acquirer availability: EPI (TSYS, VANTIV) in the United States restaurant industry only. Limited to HiLite terminals. TipAdjustmentStatus values: If two tip adjustments are sent for the same transaction, the second overrides the first."
