    "heading": "Operations — detailed reference",
    "anchor": "operations-detailed-reference",
    "level": 2,
    "content": "All financial operations (except ) return an object with: — a UUID generated client-side before the card is presented. Save this before awaiting. — a Promise that resolves with a object."
