    "pagePath": "/reference/javascript-sdk-integration-guide",
    "heading": "Get Transaction Status",
    "anchor": "get-transaction-status",
    "level": 3,
    "content": "→ Queries the Handpoint Cloud for the current status of any transaction by its . Use this for recovery after a network interruption. Parameters Code example"
