    "level": 2,
    "content": "In addition to the SDK's method, you can query the transaction outcome directly via the Handpoint Cloud REST API. This is useful for server-side reconciliation, back-office tooling, or recovery from environments where the SDK is not available (for example, immediately after a cold restart before the SDK reconnects). Different base URL The status endpoint uses (production) or (staging) — not ."
