    "content": "must be a UUID v4: Position 13 (the version digit after the third ) must be Position 17 (the variant digit after the fourth ) must be , , , or Valid: Invalid: (version digit is , not ) The API returns HTTP with message if the format is wrong. Generate it with the platform's built-in UUID library — do not construct manually:"
