    "heading": "Concurrent transactions",
    "anchor": "concurrent-transactions",
    "level": 2,
    "content": "When multiple transactions are in flight simultaneously, use to match each 202 response to its poll result. The returned in the 202 body is what you pass to , but lets you look up the correct from your own state. Always store the mapping immediately after receiving the 202."
