    "anchor": "4-required-screens",
    "level": 2,
    "content": "The Android SDK path requires the ISV to build and own the full UI. The following screens must exist and must be shown to the operator during the certification review. Certification includes a UI walkthrough — have screenshots or a short screen recording ready."
